        position: "**India's leading pick-and-carry crane maker**, also leading in tower cranes and, by management's account, in new-generation cranes for the past two years. It added capacity in FY26 by rearranging lines and renting a nearby factory, which management says is enough for current demand; a decision on a new tower-crane plant is due in September.",
